        "original_id": "960ee506-4a87-5a24-ada6-e51e5ace430d",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: SAS Technical Services, SAS Group, Scandinavian Airlines System Aktiebolag, SAS AB, SAS Business Opportunities, SAS Cargo Group, SAS Ground Services\n- People: Mats Jansson\n- Places: Arlanda, Stockholm, Solna Municipality, SAS Frösundavik Office Building, Sweden\n- Organizations: Governments of Sweden, Denmark, Norway\n- Roles: Chief Executive Officer\n\nFacts:\n- From 2007 to 2010, Mats Jansson was Chief Executive Officer of SAS Group.\n- SAS Technical Services is owned by the SAS Group and provides aircraft technical maintenance to airlines inside and outside the SAS Group.\n- SAS Technical Services is headquartered at Arlanda outside Stockholm and has 3,600 employees.\n- Scandinavian Airlines System Aktiebolag, trading as SAS Group and SAS AB, is an airline holding company headquartered in the SAS Frösundavik Office Building in Solna Municipality, Sweden.\n- SAS Group owns SAS Business Opportunities, SAS Cargo Group, SAS Ground Services, and SAS Technical Services.\n- SAS Group is partially owned by the governments of Sweden, Denmark, and Norway, with stakes of 21.4%, 14.3%, and 14.3%, respectively.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
